== 2026-10-14
  printed: Pearl Street Station began generating electricity on September 4, 1882, serving 400 lamps to 82 customers. On this day in 1913: Senghenydd colliery disaster, the United Kingdom's worst coal mining accident, claims the lives of 439 miners.
  sources line: [Wikipedia, Pearl Street Station](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pearl_Street_Station), [Wikipedia, October 14](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_14).
